{"id":"fresh-mint","name":{"en":"Fresh Mint","ja":"フレッシュミント"},"desc":{"en":"A mint leaf. It's odorless as is, but rubbing its leaves together releases a very refreshing scent.","ja":"ミントの葉っぱ。このままでは何の匂いもし ないが、葉っぱ同士を擦り合わせると段々爽 やかな香りがしてくる。あまり強く擦り続け ると、鼻に痛いくらいの刺激臭になる。"},"level":6,"locations":[{"id":"continental-coastline","name":{"en":"Continental Coastline","ja":"大陸海岸線"}},{"id":"forgotten-village","name":{"en":"Forgotten Village","ja":"忘れられた村"},"parent":"northern-ruins"}],"categories":[{"id":"plant","name":{"en":"(Plant)","ja":"（植物類）"},"icon":"totori-category-plant"},{"id":"spice","name":{"en":"(Spice)","ja":"（香料）"},"icon":"totori-category-spice"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":91}